    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombunter</strong> is a 2D platformer where you play as a fearless treasure hunter exploring mysterious underground dungeons. Equipped with a giant wrench, you will fight against dangerous enemies and use powerful bombs to destroy obstacles blocking your way to hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will encounter various traps and unexpected surprises that will test your skills and reflexes. The game features a moody lo-fi soundtrack that creates a unique and immersive atmosphere. Combined with pixel-art graphics, <i>Bombunter</i> offers a nostalgic retro experience as you uncover the secrets buried deep within the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for an adventure full of action, exploration, and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb-based obstacle destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trap-filled dungeon exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric lo-fi soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel-art graphics</p></li></ul>",
